request.description:
Powers the **أشهر العلامات التجارية** (Popular Brands) section — global variant (no module filter).

**Use this when:** Showing brands on the general Search screen without any module context.

**Same endpoint as the module-scoped variant** — only the `moduleId` header differs. Without it, all brands across all modules are returned.

**Sample response:**
```json
{
  "success": true,
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 15,
      "name": "ماكدونالدز",
      "image_full_url": "https://shellafood.com/storage/brand/logo.png"
    }
  ]
}
```

Powers the Store Details screen when a user opens a store (`/stores/:id`).

**Endpoint:** `GET /api/v2/stores/{store_id}`

**App proxy:** `GET /api/store?id={{store_id}}`

**Headers:** `zoneId`, `X-Localization`, and `Accept-Language` are required. No `moduleId` header is needed for this endpoint.

**Returns:**
```json
{
  "store_name": "هايبر شلة",
  "store_description": "شله ستور",
  "rating": 0,
  "free_delivery": true,
  "delivery_time": "30-40 min",
  "categories": [
    { "id": 2, "name": "الألبان والبيض", "full_image_url": "https://..." }
  ],
  "category_products": [
    { "id": 956, "name": "برايد ...", "full_image_url": "https://...", "price": 11 }
  ],
  "featured_store_discounted": {
    "store_id": 22,
    "logo_url": "https://...",
    "slogan": "عروض مختارة لك",
    "products": [
      {
        "id": 193058,
        "name": "لقيمات عادية - صغيرة",
        "full_image_url": "https://...",
        "original_price": 14,
        "discounted_price": 13.61
      }
    ]
  },
  "featured_store_products": {
    "store_id": 18,
    "logo_url": "https://...",
    "slogan": "منتجات من متجر آخر",
    "products": [
      { "id": 240694, "name": "ماك شيكر فرايز آسيوي", "full_image_url": "https://...", "price": 2 }
    ]
  }
}
```

**Notes:**
- `categories` powers the category grid on the store page
- `category_products` is a sample product list (typically from the first category)
- `featured_store_discounted` and `featured_store_products` may be `null` when no cross-store recommendations exist
